-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("es",340,{
[10849]="7002D5F8\n1\tUn olor maligno te atrae hacia lo profundo del Bosque de los Trolls\tTus sentidos agudos te atraen hacia una fuente de mal detectada en el Bosque de los Trolls. Si eres #-1:{derrotado[m]|derrotado[f]} o se acaba el tiempo, regresarás a los Campos de Caballos.\n2\tDestruye un fragmento de armadura negra\030Destruye un trozo de tela negra\tTrophies of the evil steed can be found in the area where it met its death. If defeated or time expires, you will return to the horsefields.\n3\tExamina una vez más la montura negra caída\tLos trofeos dejados por la montura negra caída y su jinete han sido destruidos. Con tu furia apaciguada, la curiosidad te invade. ¿Qué pudo matar a esta montura, y hacia dónde se dirigía su jinete?\n4\tEncuentra la fuente de aquello que ahuyentó a la montura negra\tUna poderosa fuerza dejó una energía misteriosa alrededor del cadáver de la montura negra, como una ola en retirada que deja pequeños charcos en la arena. La montura negra no pudo haber llegado muy lejos tras sufrir una herida tan grande. La fuente de un poder así debe encontrarse en algún lugar del Bosque de los Trolls.\n",
[10850]="7002D5F7\n1\tDirígete a Ost Guruth y encuentra allí un caballo\tHay un caballo en Ost Guruth que sientes la necesidad de buscar. Si eres #-1:{derrotado[m]|derrotada[f]} o se acaba el tiempo, regresarás a los Campos de Caballos.\n2\tDerrota a los crebain emboscadores (total: 3)\tLa hierba rara que busca el caballo de Radagast solo crece en lugares de gran altitud. El único sitio lo bastante alto en millas alrededor de Ost Guruth es la cima de la Cima de los Vientos. Si eres #-1:{derrotado[m]|derrotada[f]} o se acaba el tiempo, regresarás a los Campos de Caballos.\n3\tLleva las hierbas de vuelta al caballo de Radagast\tEl caballo de Radagast se encuentra en Ost Guruth. Si eres #-1:{derrotado[m]|derrotada[f]} o se acaba el tiempo, regresarás a los Campos de Caballos.\n",
[10851]="70072140\n1\tEavesdrop on your husband's conversation\tYou are experiencing Kotráka Saiya's story from her point of view. You should approach Góramul Sai and listen to the conversation.\n2\tTalk to your husband\tYou are experiencing Kotráka Saiya's story from her point of view. You should talk to Góramul Sai in the banquet hall.\n3\tEscucha la conversación\tYou are experiencing Kotráka Saiya's story from her point of view. You should hear what Dark Priestess Barkhuráni has to say to Góramul Sai.\n4\tTalk to your sister\tYou are experiencing Kotráka Saiya's story from her point of view. You should talk to Dark Priestess Barkhuráni in the banquet hall.\n5\tCheck on your son\tYou are experiencing Kotráka Saiya's story from her point of view. You should find Otibúk in the southern bed-chamber.\n6\tUse your Icy Glare on Ratúlko\tYou are experiencing Kotráka Saiya's story from her point of view. You should use Icy Glare on Ratúlko the Bloody to let him know how you feel.\n7\tCheck on your son\tYou are experiencing Kotráka Saiya's story from her point of view. You should find Otibúk in the southern bed-chamber.\n8\tCheck on your daughters\tYou are experiencing Kotráka Saiya's story from her point of view. You should find your daughters in the northern bed-chamber.\n9\tFind Khêjiba in the central garden\tYou are experiencing Kotráka Saiya's story from her point of view. You should find Khêjiba. She is hiding somewhere in the royal living quarters.\n10\tTalk to Lokóya\tYou are experiencing Kotráka Saiya's story from her point of view. You should return Khêjiba to the northern bed-chamber.\n11\tFind your husband\tYou are experiencing Kotráka Saiya's story from her point of view. You should find Góramul Sai in your shared bed-chamber, to the rear of the living quarters.\n12\tUse your Diplomatic Words to convince your husband\tYou are experiencing Kotráka Saiya's story from her point of view. You should use your Diplomatic Words to convince Góramul Sai to leave.\n13\tListen to your husband's words\tYou are experiencing Kotráka Saiya's story from her point of view. You should hear Góramul Sai's response.\n",
[10852]="70008772\n1\tRegresa con Gazlup en Lugazag\030Recoge fragmentos de piedra de troll (total: 5)\030Recoge los fragmentos de piedra de troll (total: 5)\tEl soldado Gazlup está en Lugazag. El soldado Gazlup te indicó que recogieras piedra de troll para reparar los daños que los trolls causaron en los muros de Lugazag.\n",
[10853]="70017584\n1\tDerrota a Drâgh\tDrâgh se encuentra en la Gran Escalera, al este de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo y al noroeste del Refugio Sombrío, en las Fundaciones de Piedra. Derrota a Drâgh en la Gran Escalera para evitar que siga interfiriendo en la expedición de los enanos en Moria.\n2\tRegresa con Armbeald en las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo\tArmbeald se encuentra en la Guardia Orca, al noroeste de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo. Regresa con Armbeald y cuéntale que Drâgh ha sido derrotado gracias a tus esfuerzos y a los de tus amigos.\n",
[10854]="70061CCC\n1\tSpeak with Akúlhun at Gramsfoot\tSpeak with War-tyrant Akúlhun about available tasks.\n",
[10855]="7004CE44\n1\tDefeat Esgaroth smugglers (total: 10)\tEsgaroth smugglers can be found in Esgaroth-of-old. You should defeat Esgaroth smugglers.\n2\tTalk to Mervárth\tMervárth can be found outside Esgaroth-of-old. You should talk to Mervárth.\n",
[10856]="7002731E\n1\tColoca las tres trampas de mandíbula cerca de las huellas hasta que las hayas usado todas (total: 3)\030Encuentra un lugar adecuado para colocar las trampas cerca de las huellas\tHas encontrado huellas en la otra orilla del lago, al noroeste de la isla y bajo los acantilados al oeste de la orilla, y ahora Wynfor quiere que coloques tres trampas que él ha fabricado en esos lugares. Wynfor te ha dado tres trampas que ha fabricado, y quiere que las coloques cerca de las huellas que encontraste antes.\n2\tHas colocado las trampas de mandíbula en Tâl Methedras, como quería Wynfor.\t\n3\tHabla con Wynfor en Tûr Morva\tWynfor está en Tûr Morva. Has colocado las trampas para Wynfor y ahora deberías regresar con él.\n",
[10857]="7002D340\n1\tRecoge hojas desafiladas (total: 6)\tLas hojas desafiladas se encuentran en los armeros en el Ala Norte del Umbral de Durin. Debes recoger varias hojas desafiladas para restaurarlas en la forja recién encendida.\n2\tUsa la forja para restaurar las hojas (total: 6)\tLa forja del Ala Norte se encuentra cerca de Athils. Debes usar la forja para restaurar las hojas que has recogido.\n3\tLleva las hojas recién restauradas a Athils\tAthils se encuentra en el Ala Norte del Umbral de Durin, supervisando el trabajo que se realiza allí. Debes llevar las hojas recién restauradas a Athils.\n",
[10858]="70044D54\n1\tTalk to Gord Dunley\tGord Dunley can be found just outside the Stone Theatre in Minas Tirith. Gord Dunley has voiced concerns about performing in the Stone Theatre and Polla has asked you to investigate.\n2\tTalk to Polla Stoutley\tPolla Stoutley can be found just outside the Stone Theatre in Minas Tirith. Gord Dunley has requested that the band perform in another space as he feels his voice is lacking in the Stone Theatre.\n3\tMeet the Cloudyheads at the Hall of Air\tThe Hall of Air can be found in the northern section of the Fifth Circle of Minas Tirith. Polla is displeased, but willing to try a different theatre at Gord's request. You should meet the Cloudyheads at the Hall of Air.\n4\tTalk to Polla Stoutley in the Hall of Air\tPolla Stoutley can be found in the Hall of Air in the Fifth Circle of Minas Tirith. You have arrived at the Hall of Air and should now talk to Polla.\n5\tTalk to Hollur\tHollur can be found in the Hall of Air. Polla has asked you to speak to Hollur about testing the theatre's acoustics.\n6\tThe Hall of Air can be found in the Fifth Circle. Polla Stoutley has asked you to sit in various seats in the Hall of Air to help Hollur ensure that the sound is even throughout the theatre.\t\n7\tTalk to Hollur\tHollur can be found in the Hall of Air. You have tested various seats in the theatre and much to your dismay, it seems there is a wide range of quality in the available seating.\n8\tHabla con Robbo Moliespalda\tRobbo Gristback is in the Hall of Air in Minas Tirith. Hollur has asked you to speak to Robbo about an idea he had on the way to the Hall of Air.\n9\tOrnate instruments can be found at various markets in Minas Tirith. Robbo Gristback hopes to purchase instruments of finer make to help his band put on a better show in Minas Tirith. He has provided the gold and has asked you to peruse the markets of the City.\t\n10\tDeliver the instruments to Robbo Gristback\tRobbo Gristback can be found in the Hall of Air in the Fifth Circle of Minas Tirith. You have acquired several new instruments for the Cloudyheads and should now deliver them to Robbo.\n11\tTalk to Polla Stoutley\tPolla Stoutley can be found in Hall of Air. You have delivered the instruments to Robbo in the Hall of Air. Robbo has informed you that Polla would like to talk to you.\n",
[10859]="7006C57B\n1\tPost the inciting letter outside of the Ordâkhai camp north of Jirush\tAmalíbi provided the notice and a sounding horn and asked you to make your way to the Ordâkhai camp north of Jirush. You need to find a suitable location to post the notice and then find a suitable place to hide, and blow the horn.\n2\tUse the sounding horn when you are concealed from the front gate\030Conceal yourself from view\tYou posted the inciting letter. You should retreat to a location concealed from the entrance and blow the sounding horn to draw a guard to gate.\n3\tReturn to Amalíbi with news from the Ordâkhai encampment\tA soldier emerged from the camp, took the note, and immediately called for Jombahok. Return to Amalíbi at Ghalbûru and tell her of the success.\n",
[10860]="7000978C\n1\tUsa Rock\030Derrota a Bonefang\tEl campamento de los lobos se encuentra al noreste de Avenal. Ahora que has traido la carne de alce, Hal Gamyi sugiere que es hora de tener la trampa para el gran lobo colocando la carne fuera de su cueva.\n2\tHabla con Hal Gamgee\030Recoge Elk-meat\tHal Gamyi está en el centro de Avenal. Debes volver con Hal Gamyi con las noticias de tu victoria.\n",
[10861]="70007043\n1\tDerrota a Hontimûrz\030Derrota a los guardias de Hontimûrz (total: 4)\tNaerost se encuentra justo al este de la Cima de los Vientos, al norte de Hunulf Mascador. Hunulf Mascador teme que los semi-orcos sirvan a un poder mayor, quizá incluso a Mordor. Te ha pedido que entres en Naerost y derrotes a su líder y a sus guardias con la esperanza de que los demás huyan.\n2\tHabla con Hunulf Mascador\tHunulf Mascador espera tu regreso en su campamento al este de Minas Eriol, al sur de Naerost. Aunque los semi-orcos no huyeron, su líder y sus guardias han sido derrotados. Debes volver a informar a Hunulf Mascador.\n",
[10862]="70044581\n1\tTalk to the mysterious woman\tThe Old Guest-house lies in the First Circle, just south of the City Gates. The mysterious woman stands before the Old Guest-house, talking to Bergil.\n2\tReturn to the breach in the cisterns\tYou can enter the cisterns at the southern end of the First Circle. The mysterious woman has bade you repair the breach where the goblins entered the cisterns before you speak further.\n3\tGather stones (total: 6)\tYou can enter the cisterns at the southern end of the First Circle. The mysterious woman has bade you repair the breach where the goblins entered the cisterns before you speak further. You should gather nearby stones for the task.\n4\tBlock up the breach\tYou can enter the cisterns at the southern end of the First Circle. The mysterious woman has bade you repair the breach where the goblins entered the cisterns before you speak further. Use the stones you've gathered to block up the hole.\n5\tTalk to Bergil\tThe breach is within the cisterns, which can be entered at the southern end of the First Circle. Bergil has come up just as you finished blocking up the breach.\n6\tLady Raenemel's house is in the Fourth Circle, near the Finding Place. Bergil wants to take you to Lady Raenemel's house.\t\n7\tTalk to Lady Raenemel\tLady Raenemel is at her house in the Fourth Circle, near the Finding Place. You have found Lady's Raenemel's house and she is outside. Now you should talk to her.\n8\tStep away from Lady Raenemel's House\tLady Raenemel's house is in the Fourth Circle, near the Finding Place. Lady Raenemel wishes to speak with you alone.\n9\tTalk to Lady Raenemel\tLady Raenemel's house is in the Fourth Circle, near the Finding Place. Lady Raenemel wishes to speak with you alone... outside her home.\n10\tStroll with Lady Raenemel\tStroll to the garden near Lady Raenemel's home in the northern half of the Fourth Circle. Lady Raenemel will stroll with you around her neighbourhood. Use the small whistle to call her, if you get separated.\n11\tTalk to Lady Raenemel\tLady Raenemel will accompany you within the Fourth Circle of the City. Use the small whistle to call her, if you get separated. Talk to Lady Raenemel and see what she has to say next.\n12\tStroll with Lady Raenemel\tStroll up onto the wall near Lady Raenemel's home in the northern half of the Fourth Circle. Lady Raenemel will stroll with you around her neighbourhood. Use the small whistle to call her, if you get separated.\n13\tTalk to Lady Raenemel\tLady Raenemel will accompany you within the Fourth Circle of the City. Use the small whistle to call her, if you get separated. Talk to Lady Raenemel and see what she has to say next.\n14\tStroll with Lady Raenemel\tContinue to stroll up on the wall near Lady Raenemel's home in the northern half of the Fourth Circle. Lady Raenemel will stroll with you around her neighbourhood. Use the small whistle to call her, if you get separated.\n15\tTalk to Lady Raenemel\tLady Raenemel will accompany you within the Fourth Circle of the City. Use the small whistle to call her, if you get separated. Talk to Lady Raenemel and see what she has to say next.\n16\tStroll with Lady Raenemel\tWalk to the fountain by the Baths near Lady Raenemel's home in the northern half of the Fourth Circle. Lady Raenemel will stroll with you around her neighbourhood. Use the small whistle to call her, if you get separated.\n17\tTalk to Lady Raenemel\tLady Raenemel will accompany you within the Fourth Circle of the City. Use the small whistle to call her, if you get separated. Talk to Lady Raenemel and see what she has to say next.\n18\tReturn to Raenemel's home\tReturn with Lady Raenemel to her home in the northern half of the Fourth Circle. Lady Raenemel will stroll with you around her neighbourhood. Use the small whistle to call her, if you get separated.\n19\tTalk to Lady Raenemel\tLady Raenemel will accompany you within the Fourth Circle of the City. Use the small whistle to call her, if you get separated. Talk to Lady Raenemel and see what she has to say next.\n20\tReturn to Lady Raenemel's house\tLady Raenemel's house is in the Fourth Circle, near the Finding Place. You should follow Lady Raenemel back to her house.\n21\tTalk to Bergil\tBergil stands outside Lady Raenemel's house in the Fourth Circle. Lady Raenemel and Bergil were speaking as you approached. Now Bergil seems to have something to say to you.\n",
[10863]="7001A4A9\n1\tDerrota a Morsharpat en Ashúrz Maufulug\tMorsharpat está en Ashúrz Maufulug, al sur y poco al oeste de Echad Glamodúd. Glamodúd te ha pedido que derrotes a Morsharpat, el capitán de los orcos en Ashúrz Maufulug.\n2\tHabla con Glamodúd en Echad Glamodúd\tGlamodúd está en Echad Glamodúd, al norte y un poco al este de Ashúrz Maufulug. Deberías volver a ver a Glamodúd con la noticia de tu victoria contra Morsharpat.\n",
[10864]="70052F9A\n1\tExplore Kidzul-kâlah\tKidzul-kâlah can be found alongside the Gladdenmere. You should destroy shadow sources and defeat any foes you find at Kidzul-kâlah.\n2\tDefeat foes at Kidzul-kâlah (total: 15)\030Destroy sources of shadow at Kidzul-kâlah (total: 10)\tKidzul-kâlah can be found alongside the Gladdenmere. You should destroy shadow sources and defeat any foes you find at Kidzul-kâlah.\n3\tCompletado\tDefeated many foes at Kidzul-kâlah.\n",
[10865]="7005278F\n1\tTalk to one of the hunters in Hultvís\tOne of the hunters from the village of Hultvís may know what has disturbed the shades in the Gladden Fields.\n2\tDefeat Orcs at Avabárg (total: 6)\tEurik asked you to defeat the Orcs he encountered at Avabárg while you search for his son.\n3\tDefeat shades on the Gladden Fields (total: 6)\tEurik believed that you might find his son among the shades of the Gladden Fields if you did not find him with the Orcs of Avabárg.\n4\t¿Qué es ese ruido?\tYou hear a faint voice calling from the north-western reaches of the Gladden Fields!\n5\tLook for Badwila in the north-west of the Gladden Fields\tBadwila disappeared somewhere in the north-western reaches of the Gladden Fields.\n6\tTalk to Badwila among the Orc corpses\tYou have found Eurik's son Badwila. He has been injured, but he is surrounded by the corpses of Orcs much less fortunate than he.\n",
[10866]="70052796\n1\tTalk to Gultháva and follow her into the flooded dwarf-hold of Kidzul-kâlah\tThe Maiden of the Gladden waits for you by the flooded dwarf-hold of Kidzul-kâlah.\n",
[10867]="70052795\n1\tCatch up to the Maiden of the Gladden further to the west in Gladdenmere\tThe Maiden of the Gladden has reappeared further to the west along the path that runs through Gladdenmere.\n2\tTalk to Gultháva, the Maiden of the Gladden\tThe Maiden of the Gladden stares at you cryptically.\n3\tCatch up to the Maiden of the Gladden further to the west along the path through Gladdenmere\tThe Maiden of the Gladden has reappeared further along the western path through Gladdenmere.\n4\tTalk to Gultháva, the Maiden of the Gladden\tThe Maiden of the Gladden stares at you with enigmatic eyes.\n5\tPick up the soil of purity\tThe Maiden of the Gladden asked you to pick up the soil of purity and sprinkle it on flowers planted by her friends throughout the Vales of Anduin.\n6\tSprinkle soil of purity on Merillif's flower\030Sprinkle soil of purity on Braiglad's flower\030Sprinkle soil of purity on Silloth's flower\030Sprinkle soil of purity on Lenhwest's flower\030Defeat Orcs or goblins in the Vales of Anduin (total: 12)\tThe Maiden of the Gladden asked you to find the flowers planted by her long-lost friends throughout the Vales of the Anduin and sprinkle the soil of purity on them. You have marked the locations she gave to you on your map: Merillif's Flower grows within the camp of Lúlstrok. Braiglad's Flower grows behind a house in Waldfast. Silloth's Flower grows on the sloping path that climbs up through Brafulug. Lenhwest's Flower grows in the camp outside the cave of Fil Sulmog.\n7\tReturn to Gultháva near the flooded dwarf-hold of Kidzul-kâlah\tThe Maiden of the Gladden waits for you by the flooded dwarf-hold of Kidzul-kâlah.\n",
[10868]="70052790\n1\tDefeat shades in the Gladden Fields (total: 10)\030Search Tol Send for Vagári the Wanderer\030Search Sharkey's Slough for Vagári the Wanderer\030Search Lúlstrok for Vagári the Wanderer\030Search Tûn Melen for Vagári the Wanderer\tGandalf has asked you to explore several locations in the Gladden Fields, defeating shades you find, and to search for Vagári the Wanderer.\n2\tYou feel a watchful presence to the west\tGandalf has asked you to explore several locations in the Gladden Fields, defeating shades you find, and to search for Vagári the Wanderer.\n3\tSearch for Vagári the Wanderer on the western side of the Gladden Fields\tYou felt something watching you from the western side of the Gladden Fields. Could it be the shade you seek?\n4\tHabla con la sombra\tYou have found a watchful presence that seems to match Badwila's description of Vagári the Wanderer on the western side of the Gladden Fields.\n5\tThe shade of Vagári the Wanderer begins to fade from view\tThe shade of Vagári the Wanderer begins to fade from view.\n6\tSearch atop the cliff path to the north-west for the new presence\tYou felt another watchful presence up the cliff path to the north-west of where you encountered Vagári the Wanderer.\n7\tTalk to Gultháva, the Maiden of the Gladden\tThe Maiden of the Gladden stands by the rocky path in Gladdenmere, watching you carefully.\n",
[10869]="70052791\n1\tTalk to Gandalf inside the Beorninghús and tell him of Badwila's frightening encounter\tGandalf is inside the Beorninghús, studying the Black Book of Mordor.\n2\tTalk to Elrond outside the Beorninghús\tElrond is outside the Beorninghús.\n3\tTalk to Gandalf inside the Beorninghús\tGandalf is inside the Beorninghús.\n",
[10870]="7003E2FF\n1\tDerrota sombras en el oeste de los Campos de Fornost (total: 10)\tLas sombras se encuentran en el oeste de los Campos de Fornost. Debes derrotar a sombras en los Campos de Fornost.\n2\tCompletado\tHas derrotado a muchas sombras en el oeste de los Campos de Fornost.\n",
[10871]="7002C9EB\n1\tHabla con Wynstan en el campamento de Aculf, en Juncal.\030Habla con Bagmund en el campamento de Aculf, en Juncal.\tWynstan y Bagmund están ambos en el campamento de Aculf, en Juncal. Aculf te ha pedido que hables con Wynstan y con Bagmund para conocer sus opiniones sobre lo que debería hacerse con las sombras.\n",
[10872]="70033047\n1\tDerrota a los orcos Ghâsh-hai en Hadâd-mezer\tHadâd-mezer se encuentra al sureste de Anazârmekhem de las Profundidades Llameantes. Debes derrotar a los orcos en Hadâd-mezer.\n2\tDerrota orcos en Hadâd-mezer (total: 8)\tHadâd-mezer se encuentra al sureste de Anazârmekhem de las Profundidades Llameantes. Debes derrotar a los orcos en Hadâd-mezer.\n3\tCompletado\tHas logrado reducir el número de orcos en Hadâd-mezer, facilitando así la entrada y salida de los enanos de Anazârmekhem.\n",
[10873]="7006025A\n1\tEnter Tûr Fúar, the Drearspire\tTûr Fúar, the Drearspire can be found at Agal Dûn. You should enter Tûr Fúar.\n2\tTalk to Múta inside the entrance of Tûr Fúar\tTûr Fúar, the Drearspire can be found at Agal Dûn. You should talk to Múta in Tûr Fúar.\n3\tSummon Múta to your side\tSummon Múta to your side.\n4\tDefeat Curcúan\030Defeat Lasairë\tTûr Fúar, the Drearspire can be found at Agal Dûn. You should defeat Curcúan and Lasairë in Tûr Fúar.\n5\tDefeat Claghórd\030Summon Claghórd\tTûr Fúar, the Drearspire can be found at Agal Dûn. You should defeat Claghórd in Tûr Fúar.\n6\tDefeat High Priestess Ásachal\tTûr Fúar, the Drearspire can be found at Agal Dûn. You should defeat High Priestess Ásachal in Tûr Fúar.\n7\tTalk to Múta in Tûr Fúar\tTûr Fúar, the Drearspire can be found at Agal Dûn. You should talk to Múta in Tûr Fúar.\n8\tTalk to Múta in the upper reaches of Tûr Fúar\tTûr Fúar, the Drearspire can be found at Agal Dûn. You should talk to Múta in the upper reaches of Tûr Fúar.\n",
[10874]="70000759\n1\tReúnete con el espía de Grimbriar\tEl espía de Grimbriar te encontrará cerca de una roca gris en un pequeño bosque, al norte de Bree. Grimbriar te ha enviado a reunirte con un espía que ha infiltrado entre los bandidos con la esperanza de que revele información sobre Zarquino y sus planes.\n2\tHabla con el Jefe de vigilancia Grimbriar\tGrimbriar se encuentra en la casa de piedra, cerca de El Cruce, fuera de Bree. Las notas del espía confirman bien lo que decía la carta de los bandidos, a saber, que Zarquino no es un bandido, sino un hombre influyente del sur. Sería bueno avisar a Grimbriar.\n",
[10875]="70054C9F\n1\tDestroy abandoned fell beast eggs (total: 8)\tAbandoned fell beast eggs can be found within Gath Daeroval, the Shadow-roost. You should destroy any abandoned fell beast eggs that you find.\n2\tCompletado\tDestroyed many abandoned fell beast eggs.\n",
[10876]="70020C88\n1\tLos rebaños de cabras pastan en las tierras al oeste de Gavar Cadlus. Grufudh te pidió que investigaras las sombras malignas que él y sus compañeros pastores vieron entre sus rebaños. Solo aparecen por la noche, pero es posible que se encuentren en otros lugares durante el día.\t\n2\tDerrota druggavar en las Lomas Ventosas (total: 3)\tHan aparecido druggavar en los rebaños de los Uch-lûth, al oeste de Gavar Cadlus. Grufudh te pidió que encontraras la forma de expulsar a los druggavar de las tierras.\n3\tHabla con Grufudh en Gavar Cadlus\tGrufudh se encuentra en Gavar Cadlus, al este de los rebaños, en las Lomas Ventosas de Enedwaith.\n",
[10877]="70020C8B\n1\tDerrota druggavar en las Lomas Ventosas (total: 3)\tLos druggavar acechan en las tierras al oeste de Gavar Cadlus. Iuan te ha pedido que encuentres a los druggavar y los expulses de Enedwaith.\n2\tHabla con Iuan en Gavar Cadlus\tIuan se encuentra en Gavar Cadlus, al este del rebaño de cabras, en las Lomas Ventosas de Enedwaith. Regresa con Iuan para contarle sobre tu victoria.\n",
[10878]="70046BF8\n1\tPatrol the abandoned refuge of Thurindath\030Patrol the abandoned refuge of Adab Dolen\030Patrol the abandoned refuge of Torngroth\tThurindath can be found far to the south-east of Henneth Annûn, Adab Dolen can be found to the north of Henneth Annûn, and Torngroth can be found far to the north-west of Henneth Annûn. Mablung has asked you to scout the old Ranger refuges of Thurindath, Adab Dolen, and Torngroth. You should seek them out and take note of what you discover.\n2\tTalk to Mablung\tMablung can be found at Henneth Annûn in North Ithilien. You have scouted the abandoned Ranger refuges and should now tell Mablung of what you discovered.\n",
[10879]="7002EF1C\n1\tDerrota a los orcos montados\t\n2\tDerrota a los orcos montados (total: 10)\tLos orcos montados se pueden encontrar en todo el Valle del Entaguas. Debes cazar a los orcos montados que patrullan el Valle del Entaguas.\n",
[10880]="7006C659\n1\tSearch three spots around Esh-kimâkhi for clues as to Eshtali's whereabouts\tSearch the Crypts of Esh-kimâkhi south of Urmâkh for signs of Mizâdi's missing husband, Eshtali. Mizâdi said he would be wearing crimson robes.\n2\tSearch around Esh-kimâkhi for clues as to Eshtali's whereabouts\tContinue searching Crypts of Esh-kimâkhi south of Urmâkh for signs of Mizâdi's missing husband, Eshtali. Mizâdi said he would be wearing crimson robes.\n3\tExamine the man to determine if he is Eshtali\tExamine the man to determine if he is Eshtali.\n4\tGive Mizâdi in Urmâkh news of her husband's death\tGive Mizâdi in Urmâkh news of her husband's death.\n",
